Refactor the addtoy  functionality to be a working Supabase based interface for uploading and  processing a pair of files to ipfs and then to the  public.toys table as appropriate.


Take a pair of files form a given <directory>/<image.ext>
the first file is an image file (.png)  or any image file extension
the second file is a json file (.json)
the name of the image file is the same as the name of the json file
the second file is the metadata of the image file

the metadata file contains information about the image file
the metadata file is in the following format
