The user will provide the directory path and  the image file name with extension, 
the image file is in the directory path provided by the user,
the metadata file is in the same directory path and the name of the file is the same as the name of the image file with the extension .json

The task is to create a consolidated metadata file that includes the partial metadata and the name of the file and the image_cid.

